    "creator": "Standard Chartered Bank PLC",
    "descriptionHtml": "Description<br>Now you can trade and monitor your stock portfolio anytime, anywhere via mobile while enjoying FREE real time quotes with SC Equities! Now you are empowered to grasp every investment opportunity and have it synchronized with your online account real time. <br>Here are some of the great features with SC Equities: <br> <br>Dashboard<br>View major market indices, create a personalised stock watch list and access real time market news.<br> <br>Portfolio<br>View all stock holdings and portfolio value at a glance.<br> <br>Trading<br>Buy and sell Hong Kong stocks with just three clicks. We support various order types which you can modify and cancel orders via the Hotline and Online Banking.<br> <br>Quote<br>Enjoy the ultimate convenience of FREE unlimited real-time stock quotes without logging in, and swipe with your finger to rotate views including detailed stock information, price charts, related market news and recent transactions made.<br> <br> <br>With SC Equities, you have control over your trades anywhere, right at your fingertips. Start trading the SC Equities way!",
